To apply, regardless of the specific project you are interested in, you
should start with the kernel tutorial on the kernel outreachy wiki page:

http://kernelnewbies.org/OutreachyIntro
See: Use our tutorial to send in your first kernel patch by November 2.

Note, however, that if you are in school for more than a short portion of
the time between December 7 and March 7, then you should rather apply for
the round next summer instead.

